<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">KOL - Nouveau Testament Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">KOLOSAYI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wu Pawuli ku bisi-Kolosayi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda Pawuli ku bisi-</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolosayi</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda Pawuli wu kasonika ku minkwikidi mii ku mbanza yi Kolosayi. Wudi wukedika ti Pawuli ka sala tula koko ko, kansi wuyuwa ti minkwikidi mii koko mikwikama midi mu kiminu. Ni mukundi andi Epafala wu basamunina ntete Musamu Wumbote.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwa ndambu yi mimvu mihyoka, bahiika bayenda koko, na balonga ku bantu mwa dyambu diswasana na Musamu Wumbote wu balonga Epafala. Bedi bateelanga ti yondowo tiidi ti Nzambi ka mvuukisa, fweti fukimina zimbazi, na bima bihiika bivudidi bantu. Babwesa bateela dyaka ti, bafweti zengoso bubakala na balendi bwesa dya dyaka bima bihiika ko. Buna Epafala wuyenda yenikina Pawuli ku mbanza Loma ku kabeela mu boloko mu muteela wo. Pawuli bu kayuwa wo, ni kabasonikina mukanda, mu balonka ti ni kiminu kaka mu Klisto kilendi sa ti muntu kavuuka.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi buuku bedidi ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Mbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Lusambulu lumvutudulu yi matondo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:3-14">1.3-14</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Nani Klisto kadi, nkye misamu kahiika (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:15-2:19">1.15–2.19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Luzingu lumona mu Yesu Klisto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:20-4:6">2.20–4.6</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Mbote zimansukina (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4.7-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Meno Pawuli, ntumwa yi Yesu-Klisto mu luzolo lu Nzambi, na mpangi eto Timote,<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Tusonokini ku bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi bakwe banga ku mbanza Kolosayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yidi mwa mbanza mu kizunga ki Filingya,</char></note>, na zimpangi zeto zikwikama mu Klisto: Bika Nzambi, Tata dyeto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu mikanda mihiika minkulu bakwe bwesanga na Mfumu Yesu Klisto.</char></note> kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusambulu lu mvutudulu yi matondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Tukwe tatamananga mu vutula matondo ku Nzambi eto, Tata di Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto, mu ntangu yi tukwe lusambidilanga. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Mu dyambu ti tuyuwidi nsangu zi kiminu kyeno mu Yesu-Klisto na luzolo lweno mu bantu balongo bamvimba, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />mu dyambu di kivuvu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fwanikisa na 1 Kol 13.13.</char></note> kyeno mu mi balukubikila mu mazulu, kivuvu ki luteka yuwa mu mambu ma kedika, Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Musamu Wumbote bewowo wutula ku yeno, bonso bu wuna buta mbutu na wuna mwangana mu nza yimvimba, bonso bu wusa mpe ku yeno tuka kilumbu ki luyuwa na ki luzaba mu kedika mu mulemvo wu Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Ni Epafalasi, mukundi eto wuzola mu kisalu, wululonga mambu bemomo. Yandi wuna sala mu dyambu dyeno bonso kisadi kikwikama mu Klisto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fwanikisa na 4.12. Malongi ma Epafalasi maba na lulendo lu zintumwa. </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yandi wuna sala mu dyambu dyeno: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikanda mihiika minkulu mii misonama: yandi wuna sala mu dyambu dyeto.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Yandi mpe wututedidi mu nkye luzolo Mpeve kana lutwadisila.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Ni hahoho yeto tukwe lusambidilanga ntangu zimvimba tuka kilumbu ki tuyuwa nsangu zeno. Tukwe lombanga ku Nzambi kalufulusa mu nzayilu yi luzolo lwandi, mu ndwenga zimvimba na mu madyela ma kimpeve. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Mwanki ludyatila bonso bufwanakani ha meso ma Mfumu, mu hidika misamu mi kakwe tyanga. Mbo luhidika mavanga mambote makwe butanga mbutu, na mbo lukula mu nzayilu ye toma zaba Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Tuna lomba ku Nzambi ka lukindisa mu misamu mimvimba mu lulendo lu nkembo andi, mu ba bantu ba tatamana na mu vibidila nkwamusu zimvimba. Mu kyese, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />vutuleeno matondo ku Tata Nzambi wusidi ti luba bantu balenda tambula kikunku ki fwa dikasiila nsilulu ku bantu bandi ba kavwidi baa mu kati di kya. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Yandi wutukuula mu lulendo lu tombe na wutukotisa mu kimfumu ki Mwana andi wu katomini tya. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Ni mu yandi tubakila nkudulu na tutambula ndemvokolo yi masumu meto.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Klisto ni Mfumu yi bimvimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Mwana wudi kifwani ki Nzambi yikwe lembolo yenikanga. Yandi wuntete wuteka butuka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">wuntete wuteka butuka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwana wuntete wuteka butuka: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fwanikisa na </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 8:32-36">Zin 8.32-36</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-3">Yoa 1.1-3</ref></char> Dina lonka kintwadi kingolo kidi ha kati di Yesu na Nzambi. Yandi ba muhidika ko bonso bima bimvimba bihiika bii ha nza.</note> mu bimvimba bi hidika Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Mu dyambu ti, mu yandi Nzambi kahidikila bima bimvimba bii ku yulu na bii ha butoto, bikwe yenikanga na bikwe lembolo yenikanga, bintinu, bimfumu, minyadi na mintwadisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kibuku bekiki kina tangumuna lulendo lu zimpeve zihiika mu ntangu yi ntama, bantu bedi banzanga ti zawu mpe zedi yaalanga nza beyiyi yikwe yenikanga na nza yi kinzambi </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 4:3">Ngl 4.3</ref></char></note>. Ni mu yandi na mu dyambu dyandi Nzambi kahidikila bima bimvimba. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Yandi wudi tekila bima bimvimba biba, mpe mu yandi bimvimba bikwe tamananga mu zinga. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Yandi ni mutu wu nitu, nitu ni dibundu. Yandi ni mbadukulu, muntu wuntete wufuluka mu bafwa, mwanki kaba wuntete mu bimvimba. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi wuyena bumbote ti kinzambi kimvimba kiba mu Mwana. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Mu Mwana, Nzambi kasa ti bimvimba biwawana nandi, byo bi ha butoto na bi ku yulu. Ni mu menga ma Mwana andi matengolo ha kulunsi, Nzambi ka haanina kiyenge ku bantu bamvimba.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Yeno mpe luba kitatu na Nzambi, mpe mitantu myandi mu dyambu di mabanza na mavanga meno mambi, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />kansi bwabu, Nzambi siidi ti, mu lufwa lu nitu nsuni lu Mwana andi, luwawana mwanki kaluyenikisa ha meso mandi bantu balongo, bavedila na balembolo ba na kibila. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Kansi lufweti ba mu kiminu, bantu ba sikama na bakwikama, mwanki lulembolo hengama mu kivuvu kii neeno mu Musamu Wumbote wuluyuwa. Musamu Wumbote bewowo wusamunu mu nza yimvimba, meno Pawuli nayikila kisadi.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kisalu ki Pawuli mu Dibundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Meno bwabu nyangaladi mu mpasi zi nina yena mu dyambu dyeno. Mu dyambu ti bwabobo nina lungisila mu nitu ani, mimvimba milembolo ba mu mpasi zi yena Klisto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mimvimba milembolo ba mu mpasi zi yena Klisto </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu ndinga yi bangeleke mpova yi «mpasi», yayoyo kwandi bakwe sadilanga mu zonzila: zintontolo, nzungu. Ni bakwe sadilanga yo mu zonzila zintontolo zidi mu kisalu kye mwangisa Musamu wu Mbote mpe na zintontolo zitadidi nsukunu yi ntangu. Fwanikisa na Mat. 4; Nzayikusu 7.14.</char></note> mu nitu andi. Nitu beyoyo, ni dibundu. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Meno nayika kisadi mu dibundu, bonso buu kisalu kimpaana Nzambi mu yeno: kulonga mimvimba mi tadidi Mambu ma Nzambi, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Mambu ma Nzambi bemomo ni mabanza maba maswama tuka ntama ku zimbandu zimvimba. Kansi bwabu Nzambi zabikisi mo ku balongo bandi. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi wutya mu bazabikisa bonso budi bunene bu kimvwama ki mabanza maba maswama ha kati di yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo. Mabanza bemomo maba maswama ni Klisto wuu mu yeno. Wuna luhaana kivuvu kye kota mu nkembo yi Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Ni Klisto bewowo tuna samuna ku bantu bamvimba. Tuna balwengisa na tuna balonga mu madyela mamvimba mana tuhaana Nzambi. Mwanki tulonka ku Nzambi kadi muntu wukudidi mu Klisto. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Ni mu dyodyodyo meno nina sadila, mpe nina nwana mu ngolo zi Klisto wuna sala mu lulendo lumvimba mu meno.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Ntiidi ti luzaba bunene bu mvita yi nina nwananga mu dyambu dyeno na mu dyambu di bantu ba ku Lawodise mpe na bantu bamvimba ba ka banyeni. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Ntiidi ti baba na kibakala, bakangama mu kintwadi ki luzolo mpe bafuluka mu dyela di lunga, mu zaba mansweki ma Nzambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mansweki ma Nzambi, ni yandi bende Klisto: Mu mikanda mihiika basonika mansweki ma Nzambi; mihiika: mansweki ma Nzambi Tata di Klisto; mihiika dyaka: mansweki ma Nzambi mpe Tata na ma Klisto.</char></note>: ni Klisto, <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />ni mu yandi mu muswama bimvwama bimvimba bi ndwenga na bi nzayilu. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Nina luteela bobo mwanki ha lembolo ba muntu lenda luhuna mu binzonzi bimbote. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Kaati ti ni neeno kintwadi mu nsuni ko, kansi mu kimpeve ni neeno, mpe nii na kyese mu yena ti luu basyama mpe bakwikama mu kiminu kyeno mu Klisto.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luzingu lu bantu mu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Bwabu bu lutambudi Mfumu Yesu-Klisto, dyateeno mu yandi. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Beeno bamena myanzi na batungu mu yandi, beeno bakwikama mu kiminu, mpe beeno bantu bakwe toma vutulanga matondo ku Nzambi.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Kebeeno kweno, muntu kalembolo lu baka mu mutambu wu mbanzulu zi bantu zi luvunu na zi lembolo ba mu nzila. Zidi zi kangama mu misamu mi kinkulu ki bantu, mu ndongosolo zii bonso makunzi mu sikamani mabanza ma bantu ha nza beyiyi, kansi ka mu Klisto ko. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Mu dyambu ti mimvimba mi mu Nzambi, midi nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Yeno mpe mu yandi ludi bafuluka mu bimvimba, yandi wuu mfumu yi bimfumu bimvimba na lulendo lumvimba.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Mu yandi luzengosolo bubakala, mu nzengosolo yi lembolo sadulu mu moko ma bantu, kansi mu Klisto wu tukuula mu lulendo lu masumu ma be yaalanga nitu eto. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Bu balubotika, baluziika kintwadi na Klisto, mu yandi mpe lufuluka nandi kintwadi bu lukwikila mu lulendo lu Nzambi wu mufulukisa mu bafwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fwanikisa na Loma 6.4</char></note>. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Mu ntama, yeno luba bantu bafwa mu dyambu di masumu meno, na bu luba bantu balembolo zengoso bubakala. Kansi bwabu, Nzambi wuluheeni dyaka luzingu mu Klisto. Yandi wu tulemvokidi masumu meto mamvimba. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Yandi wukyakuna mukanda wedi tufundanga, wuba na nsadulu zi lembolo ba zimbote ku yeto. Klisto wukatula wo na wukoma wo ha kulunsi. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Wumanisa ngolo zi bimfumu na lulendo lu zimpeve. Wusempidika zo ha meso ma bantu bamvimba bu kedi ze nata bonso zinkole mu mukembo andi wu kabanungina ha kulunsi.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Ni hahoho, muntu kalufundisandi mu dyambu ditadidi bindya hoti malamu ko, mu dyambu ditadidi mukembo hoti mbikulu yi ngonda ko, hoti kilumbu ki saba. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Bimvimba bebyobyo bii kwandi bonso kinsinsya ki bima byaakwiza, kansi kikedika ni mu Klisto. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Lutambulandi ko ti balubedisa ku yobobo bakwe tyanga mu kiyenikisa ti yawu bantu ba luyinunu mpe mu sambila zimbazi. Bantu ba bobobo bakwe vula haananga zimbweno zawu mfunu, na mbanzulu zawu zi kimuntu zi nasa ti baba bafuluka mu mayama malembolo kisalu. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Bantu bebobo baa bakangama mu Klisto ko, wudi mutu. Ni mu Klisto nitu yimvimba, yidi yidikulu na yidi yitoma bundana ha kimosi misunya na bihisi, yikwe kudilanga bonso butiidi Nzambi.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa na kuzinga mu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Yeno luu bafwa ha kimosi na Klisto mpe lukuulu mu lulendo lu zimpeve zikwe yaalanga nza. Bila nki luna natina luzingu bonso ti yeno bantu ba nza beyiyi ludi, mu tambula balukwika mu landa nsadulu bezizi: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />«Kubongandi ko», «kubimbandi ko», «Kusimbandi ko»? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Nsadulu bezozo zikwe zimbalanga bu bameni sadila zo. Ntumunu na ndongosolo zi bantu kwandi zidi. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Nsadulu bezozo zina yenika bonso nsadulu zi ndwenga, mu dyambu ti zina lonka lusambulu mu luzolo lu muntu yandi bende, luyinunu, na kuyenisa nitu mpasi. Kansi, zii mfunu ko, mpe kisalu kyawu ni mu yangidika kwandi nsuni.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Tala ti lufuluka mu bafwa na Klisto, soseeno bima bi ku yulu, kuu Klisto wuzakala ha ndambu yi lubakala lu Nzambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Mukunga 110.1</char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Soseeno bima bii ku yulu, kansi ka bima bii ha butoto ko. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Mu dyambu ti, luu bafwa, mpe luzingu lweno luu luswekama na Klisto mu Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Mu ntangu Klisto, wuu luzingu lweno, bu kaayenika, yeno mpe lwaayenika nandi mu mukembo andi.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luzingu luntama na luzingu lumoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Bikeeno nkadulu zeno zi kinza: kindumba, busafu, mpwila zimbi, nzinunu zimbi, mboki nsatu yi bimvwama yidi nsambudulu yi biteki. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Misamu myamyomyo mikwe natanga mankesi ma Nzambi ku bantu bakwe lembolo mutumiminanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bantu bakwe lembolo mutumiminanga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikanda mihiika mii na mambu bemama ko.</char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Bwabobo mpe bubeela ndyatulu eno mu ntangu yi luba mu kinanga ki masumu.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Kansi bwabu, looseeno misamu bemimi mimvimba: Mankesi, nganzi, mutima mbalu, matoola, na mpova zi nsoni zikwe totokanga mu minwa myeno. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Luhunasanandi yeno na yeno ko, mu dyambu ti lumana bika nkadulu eno yi ntama na nsadulu zandi, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />yeno lulweti nkadulu yimoona, lweka bantu bamona, Nzambi wuluhidika, ba kakwe kitulanga ntangu zimvimba mu kifwani kyandi, mwanki lutoma mu zaba bumbote. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Bwabu kusiidi dyaka Bayudayo hoti balembolo ba Bayudayo ko, bazengoso bubakala hoti balembolo zengoso bubakala ko, ka banzenza ko, ka basenzi ko, ka mindongo hoti bantu bakimpwanza ko, kansi ni Klisto kaka wuu mfunu mu bimvimba mpe wudi mu bamvimba.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Ni hahoho, yeno buludi bantu basoolo ku Nzambi, bantu balongo na bakatomini tya, beeno na mitima mii mifuluka mu nkenda, mu mbote, mu luyinunu, mu lembami na mu mvibudulu. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Vibidileeno nkadulu zi baneeno yeno na yeno, mpe lemvokileeno baneeno tala ti muntu wu na dyambu na munandi. Bonso Mfumu kakwe tulemvokilanga, yeno mpe lemvokileeno baneeno. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Kansi mu mimvimba, zolasaneeno, mu dyambu ti luzolo lukwe sanga ti luba mu kintwadi kilunga. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Bika kiyenge ki Klisto kiyaala mu mitima myeno, mu dyambu ti mu kiyenge bekyokyo, Nzambi kalutumisina mu ba nitu yimosi. Mpe lufweti vutudilanga matondo! <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Bika mambu ma Klisto ma fuluka mu mitima myeno mu kivwama kyawu kimvimba. Longasaneeno na lwengasaneeno yeno na yeno mu ndwenga zimvimba mu Mikunga, mu mikunga mi nzitusu, na mu mikunga mi kimpeve. Yimbidileeno Nzambi mu mitima myeno mimvimba mu muvutudilanga matondo. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Mimvimba mi lwaahidika mu mpova hoti mu mavanga, hidikeeno myo mu nkumbu yi Mfumu Yesu, mpe vutulangeeno matondo ku Nzambi Tata mu yandi.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndyatulu mu luzingu lumoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Bakento, lufweti tumamananga babakala beno, bonso bufwanakani ha meso ma Nzambi.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Babakala, lufweti zola bakento beno, mpe lu bafweminangandi ko.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Yeno baala, lufweti tumiminanga bibuti byeno mu mimvimba, kadi Mfumu bwabobo kakwe tyanga.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Yeno matata, lufwemisangandi baala beno ko, mwanki balembolo lebakana.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Yeno mindongo, lufweti tumiminanga mu mimvimba ku zimfumu zeno zi ha butoto, lusangandi bo ha meso mawu kaka mu bayangidika ko, kansi tumamangeeno ku yawu mu mutima wuzibuka, mu dyambu ti luu na bunkuta mu Mfumu. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Kyonso kisalu ki lwaasala, saleeno kyo mu mutima wumosi, bonso ti Mfumu luna sadila, kansi ka bantu ko. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Zabeno ti, Mfumu waaluhaana musendo wu fwa di kakubikila bantu bandi. Mfumu yi lukwe sadilanga, ni Klisto. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Kansi, yondowo kwe hidikanga mimbi, waatambula musendo mu mambi mandi ma kakwe hidikanga, mu dyambu ti Nzambi kakwe talanga kiini ki muntu ko.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Yeno zimfumu, hidikeeno misamu mimbote na midedama ku mindongo myeno. Lufweti zaba ti, yeno mpe Mfumu yii neeno ku mazulu.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumunu zi manunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Tatamaneeno mu sambila, kayeeno meso mu lusambulu mpe vutulangeeno matondo ku Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Bu lwaasambila, tusambidilangeeno mpe, mwanki Nzambi ka tuzibudila nzila ye longa mambu mandi na mu samuna mansweki ma mabanza mandi mu Klisto, ma nididi mu boloko, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />mwanki na zabikisa mo bonso bufwanakani.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Dyatileeno mu ndwenga ha kati di balembolo ba mu Klisto, mboki sadileeno ntangu. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Bika mpova zeno zibanga zimbote na zikwe yangidikanga mu yuwa, mboki zabeeno mu vutula mvutu yi fwanakani ku wonso muntu.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zimbote zimanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tisiki, mpangi eto yi zola, kisadi ki kwikama, mpe mukundi ani mu kisalu ki Mfumu, waaluyadila mpolo zimvimba. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Nina mutambika ku ludi, mwanki kaluyadila mpolo zi tutadidi, mpe kalusyamisa. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Wuna kwiza na Onezime, mpangi eto yi zola na yi kwikama, wudi wumosi mu yeno. Mbo baluzabikisa mimvimba mi na hyoka kuku.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Alisitalaki, mukundi ani wu boloko, mpe Malako, mpangi yi Banabase, balutambikidi mbote. Baluzabikisi bwedi lufweti sa ku Malako. Tala ti wizidi ku yeno, mubwaneeno bumbote. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Yesu wu bakwe tuminisinanga ti Yusutuse, wulutambikidi mpe mbote. Ni yawu kaka mu kati di Bayudayo bana sala naani mu dyambu di ki Kimfumu ki Nzambi. Bana nkindisanga bubwingi.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafalasi, wumosi mu yeno, wulutambikidi mbote. Kisadi bekiki ki Yesu-Klisto wuna kimfuzi mu lusambidilanga ntangu zimvimba, mwanki lutelama nakekete, luba bakula mu kimpeve, mpe luba balunga mu sadila luzolo lu Nzambi mu mimvimba. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Nina muteela kimbangi bekiki, mu dyambu ti wuna sala bubwingi mu dyambu dyeno na mu dyambu di bisi mbanza yi Lawodise na yi Yelapolisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lawodise na Yelapolisi zimbanza zi bela-bela ziba na mbanza Kolosayi. Zawu ziba mpe ku nsuku yi Likusi</char></note>. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luka, mukundi eto wuu mumbuki, na Demasi, balutambikidi mbote.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Haaneeno mpe mbote ku mpangi zeto zii ku mbanza Lawodise. Haaneeno mpe mbote ku Nimifa na ku dibundu dikwe kutakananga mu kati di nzo andi. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Bu lwaamana tanga mukanda bewuwu, fileeno wo ku dibundu di ku mbanza yi Lawodise batanga wo. Yeno mpe, tangeeno mukanda waafuma ku mbanza Lawodise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mukanda waafuma ku mbanza Lawodise </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mukanda bee wo ku bisi Lawodise wuzimbala. Mwa ndambu yi bantu ba ndwenga bakwe banzanga ti wulenda ba mukanda «ku bisi Efeso»</char></note>. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Teleeno Alisipo: «Katoma sala kisalu ki katambudi ku Mfumu, mwanki kamanisa kyo bumbote.»<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Mu kooko kwani nsonikini misamu bemimi: Tambuleeno mbote zi fumini ku meno Pawuli, bambukeno moyo ti, mu boloko nidi. Bika Nzambi kalusakumuna!<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>